{"id": 1007514, "slug": "flower-in-us", "name": "Flower in Us", "name_original": "Flower in Us", "description": "Flower in Us is a short, story-driven mystery adventure that invites players to unravel hidden secrets.<br/>\n<br/>\r\nThe first thing you notice is the darkness of the basement as you awaken, your memory wiped clean by a brutal attack. Nearby, a young woman is tied up, her eyes filled with a familiarity you can’t place – she seems to know who you are, but you don’t remember her.<br/>\n<br/>\r\nExplore the basement, examine the objects around you, and search for clues that might lead to your escape from this mysterious place. If you’re unsure where to start, try talking to the girl. She may hold unexpected insights.<br/>\n<br/>\r\nCan you break free from the cycle of this basement and uncover the dark secrets of your past? And will you unravel the truth behind the girl's hidden darkness, forging a genuine bond with her along the way?", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-07-25", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-12-31T23:52:59", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/ee7/ee7066ad2c82b853491c47020bf50a02.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f91/f91b316ab18c3ed5b8c9f15215add1ad.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 5, "added_by_status": {"owned": 3, "beaten": 1, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 1, "suggestions_count": 223, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "rev